  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>Whether it's guns, a bow and arrow, or something else, you know your aim is true.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to the @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry} power. If you already have @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}, either skip it or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one or more of the remaining dice to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.KziYDpbuojnthfT5]{Swinging}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Information qualities category</p><p>• Select from Mental qualities category</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, one using @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry} and the other using one of your qualities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.148AbHjRtdl3Rha6]{Dual Wielder}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.tT4vu7o697Op2yDV]{Load}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.AluvtGwJSkdf4XLW]{Precise Shot}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.dvbFMv65zHv4frfM]{Sniper Aim}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.xDtbK6AiPjbKM0Hf]{Spin & Shoot}</li></ul><p>Gain two of the following Yellow abilities, using two different qualities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.mi1P6JukisPzptzZ]{Called Shot}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ApS6H8WML4YPpBJq]{Exploding Ammo}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.001KS0j5H863Xd47]{Hair Trigger Reflexes}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.CcgG4Q1nAIYsp6hv]{Ricochet}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose a Responsibility principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
